// # Advanced Bioinformatics, CRISPR & Structural Proteomics Facade
//
// Logline: Unified facade re-exporting CRISPR design, structural proteomics, alignments, phylogenetics, variants, and RNA structures.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and facade importing all 49 bio_advanced companion submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular Advanced Bioinformatics, CRISPR & Proteomics subcomponents.
//   2. Re-export public constructors, scoring engines, coordinate transformers, and algorithm entry points.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility with downstream openOODA callers.

